{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43493","headline":"册上公太常奏雅乐 · 无名氏","name":"册上公太常奏雅乐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司乐陈金石，逶迤引上公。\n奏音人语绝，清韵佩声通。\n应律烟云改，来仪鸟兽同。\n得贤因举颂，修礼便观风。\n圣寿三称内，天欢九奏中。\n寂寥高曲尽，犹自满宸聪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43493.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43493","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}